{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokobos 2 is a modern twist on the classic block-pushing formula, inspired by Greek tragedies. You must load all the vases into your cart, but the cart moves too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.poster.avif?t=1758304570\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.webm?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.mp4?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience small and handcrafted puzzles focused on &quot;aha!&quot; moments with interesting interactions and clever solutions. Some objects can be pushed into water to create a bridge, while others float and drift away with the current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both Sokoban newcomers and veterans alike! Sokobos 2 offers a unique twist and smooth learning curve that welcomes newcomers but respects their problem-solving later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Ancient Greece. You have upset the Gods, and collecting the vases for eternity is your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brief Summary</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cart isn't just a container, it's part of the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond vases and the cart, interact with gates, pressure plates, water mechanics, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals keeping the focus on puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaches new interactions clearly but trusts your problem-solving skills afterward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story inspired by Greek tragedies</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thanks for the support!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/aa74b2677791164f11ec9dd6edce8fd5d1a9a286.jpg"},{"name":"Old Woman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/23fa5e66ae704e7da1fb80eeba88252f7db1546d.jpg"},{"name":"Old Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/25cccd4eddec79e26b383d6a69c3039f303bf923.jpg"},{"name":"Young Woman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/25997defbc89b0b0809f3b6246ecc1942c746416.jpg"},{"name":"Suspicious Men","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/f2273ae6e0e62772f9c57057f1ea948755328d52.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/d6e1256f9270de99a75680063c5b0a23b4adfb7b.jpg"},{"name":"Riddle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/ff33109dd7e6b67832f3b1f599fb8562e1aea7e6.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Vase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/8b860af6b84620f2742029f2d3d3cce14ed50db5.jpg"},{"name":"This Was His Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/893c17d21a582d0316f85cd4482346989fd36f60.jpg"},{"name":"What are you doing there?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422180/2e6cca1551317753b2af01c16549c1b586c1d8f3.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422180